{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":25,"ref":"2-kings 10:25","book":"2-kings","lang":"sv","chapter":10,"translation":"Och det h\u00e4nde sig, n\u00e4r han hade fullbordat br\u00e4nnoffret, att Jehu sade till l\u00f6parna och till tredjedelsm\u00e4nnen: G\u00e5 in, sl\u00e5 dem ; ingen man f\u00e5r komma ut. Och de slog dem med sv\u00e4rdens egg, och l\u00f6parna och tredjedelsm\u00e4nnen kastade ut dem, och de gick \u00e4nda till staden, Baals hus.","tokens":[{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d9\u05d4\u05d9","gloss":"Och det h\u00e4nde sig"},{"surface":"\u05db\u05db\u05dc\u05ea\u05d5","gloss":"n\u00e4r han hade fullbordat"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05e2\u05e9\u05d5\u05ea","gloss":"att g\u00f6ra"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05e2\u05dc\u05d4","gloss":"br\u00e4nnoffret"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d9\u05d0\u05de\u05e8","gloss":"sade"},{"surface":"\u05d9\u05d4\u05d5\u05d0","gloss":"Jehu"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05e8\u05e6\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"till l\u00f6parna"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05dc\u05e9\u05dc\u05e9\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"och till tredjedelsm\u00e4nnen"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05d0\u05d5","gloss":"g\u00e5 in"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05db\u05d5\u05dd","gloss":"sl\u00e5 dem"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05d9\u05e9","gloss":"ingen man"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05dc","gloss":"inte"},{"surface":"\u05d9\u05e6\u05d0","gloss":"f\u00e5r komma ut"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d9\u05db\u05d5\u05dd","gloss":"och de slog dem"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05e4\u05d9","gloss":"med egg (bokstavligen 'mun')"},{"surface":"\u05d7\u05e8\u05d1","gloss":"av sv\u00e4rd"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d9\u05e9\u05dc\u05db\u05d5","gloss":"och de kastade ut"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05e8\u05e6\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"l\u00f6parna"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d4\u05e9\u05dc\u05e9\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"och tredjedelsm\u00e4nnen"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d9\u05dc\u05db\u05d5","gloss":"och de gick"},{"surface":"\u05e2\u05d3","gloss":"\u00e4nda till"},{"surface":"\u05e2\u05d9\u05e8","gloss":"staden"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05d9\u05ea","gloss":"hus"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05d1\u05e2\u05dc","glo